@startuml
' A box inside a box (Teoz): the inner one stands in the outer one's
' padding, under its title, in a color of its own; a title wider than
' what it holds widens the box, inside the one around it too.
!pragma teoz true
box "Internal service" #LightBlue
participant Gateway
box "Billing team, invoices and payments" #LightYellow
participant Invoices
participant Payments
end box
end box
participant Bank
Gateway -> Invoices : bill
Invoices -> Payments : charge
Payments -> Bank : transfer
@enduml
